<title>THAILAND: Siam Commercial Bank raises lending rates.</title>
<headline>Siam Commercial Bank raises lending rates.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Siam Commercial Bank Plc said on Thursday it raised its lending rates 100 basis points, effective immediately.</p>
<p>The bank said its minimum lending rate (MLR) rose to 13.75 percent from 12.75, minimum overdraft rate (MOR) to 14.50 percent from 13.50, and minimum retail rate (MRR) to 14.50 percent from 13.50. -- Bangkok newsroom (662)-6520642</p>
</text>
